        27
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://encyclopediaofalabama.org/article/river-falls/"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Virtually all residents worked for the Horseshoe Lumber Company and lived in company‑leased housing into the twentieth century.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
